    "row": 158,
    "text": "158 Osmosis On Grenade Ability Usage: Refills 50% of Magazine Changes Weapon Element to match Equipped Grenade-Element until stowed. Kinetic Damage Weapons lose their Combatant Damage Bonus . Can only refill once per activation until weapon is stowed. Effects that replace Grenade Abilities will trigger Osmosis , replacing the weapon's element with the currently equipped grenade . ↑Passively grants +5 Handling.",
    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 119px\"><th id=\"1662574278R157\" style=\"height: 119px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 119px\">158</div></th><td class=\"s35\">Osmosis</td><td class=\"s25\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:119px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYLSk0-aBzjmhxxx9zs0qOQPp3vujOyBvuWxnpJrxYUtXY_gtHldTke4E8XZfuU3kFqoQbeFiDqViBl5TcP8RnSCoKji9G4K6cr2O4fIb_5cDPIMIyat5sLvYZRfWXrgqixhwmdJto_CQ1aLogrUzOeIIBxJThHPzdr=w70-h119\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s19\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">On </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;\">Grenade Ability</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> Usage:<br></span>Refills 50% of Magazine<br>Changes <span style=\"color:#d5a6bd;\">Weapon Element</span> to match <span style=\"color:#e0a261;\">Equipped Grenade-Element</span><span style=\"color:#d5a6bd;\"> </span>until stowed.<br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;\">Kinetic Damage Weapons</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> lose their </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;\">Combatant Damage Bonus</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">. </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;\">Can only refill once per activation until weapon is stowed.<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">Effects that replace </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;\">Grenade Abilities</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> will trigger </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;\">Osmosis</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">, replacing the </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;\">weapon&#39;s element</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\"> with the currently </span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;\">equipped grenade</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">.<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑Passively grants +5 Handling.</span></td></tr>"
